<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-PERU BEAT VENEZUELA 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU BEAT VENEZUELA 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SUCRE, Bolivia 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru beat Venezuela 2-0</p>
<p>(haftime 1-0) in a Copa America first round group B match</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Paul Cominges (15, 59)</p>
</text>
